#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<p>Welcome to RSIBreak</p>\n"
"<p>In your tray you can now see RSIBreak.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Willkamen bi RSIBreak</p>\n"
"<p>In den Systeemafsnitt vun't Paneel is RSIBreak nu to bekieken.</p>\n"

#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:90
msgid ""
"<p>When you right-click on that you will see a menu, from which you can go "
"to the configuration for example.</p>\n"
"<p>When you want to know when the next break is, hover over the icon.</p>\n"
"<p>Use RSIBreak wisely.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Mit en Rechtsklick kannst Du en Menü opropen, över dat Du a.B. na de "
"Instellen kamen kannst.</p>\n"
"<p>Wenn Du weten wullt, wannehr de nakamen Paus kummt, wies mit de Muus op't "
"Lüttbild.</p>\n"
"<p>Bruuk RSIBreak klook.</p>"

